usage: install_tto.py [-h] [--prefix PREFIX]
                      [--offline-wheelhouse OFFLINE_WHEELHOUSE]

TTO本地安装：创建独立环境、安装锁定包、核对身份、离线doctor。

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --prefix PREFIX       独立安装目录，默认~/TTO
  --offline-wheelhouse OFFLINE_WHEELHOUSE
                        匹配目标系统/CPU/Python的离线依赖wheel目录；指定后pip禁止访问索引
